# What NOT to upload when deploying with `vercel --prod`.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory, not the git tree, and without this file that is
# 981 MB: the whole Godot project, its 195 MB addon asset pack, its 107 MB import cache, the
# QA evidence and node_modules. The upload times out and aborts in a loop.
#
# The deploy needs exactly three things: web/ (the exported game), api/ (the Axie lookup
# proxy, which the browser build cannot do without because the GraphQL gateway sends no CORS
# headers) and tools/vercel-build.sh, which vercel.json runs to stage web/ into build/.

godot
production
design
docs
src
assets
third_party
node_modules
.git
.github
.claude
build

# Root files that are for the repository, not the deploy.
README.md
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
LICENSE
FINISH.sh
export-web.sh
push-to-github.sh
HANDOFF-PUSH.md
build.py
package.json
package-lock.json
